# Yuchen Open Source License (YOSL-1.0) — Attribution Required

Copyright © 2026 **Youchen (游尘)**. All rights reserved except as expressly granted below.

Original source: <https://github.com/youchen-yc>

### Preamble

This license is established by Youchen ("the Author") and applies to all works published by the Author under it. The Author grants these rights freely — to anyone, for any purpose, including commercial use — on one condition: **attribution**. Whoever uses or references the work, in whole or in part, including its ideas, designs, architectures and thinking, must clearly state its origin and the Author.

### 1. Definitions

**1.1 "Work"** means all content published by the Author under this license, including but not limited to source and object code, packages, plugins, scripts, configuration, build artifacts, tests, documentation, diagrams, icons and interface designs, visual assets, data structures, algorithms, architectures, engineering methods, design ideas and opinions, and any part, adaptation, translation, compilation, derivative or redistribution thereof.

**1.2 "Reference"** means any use, copy, excerpt, transcription, reproduction, distribution, publication, sublicensing, sale, integration, compilation, decompilation, modification, porting, rewriting, translation, demonstration, teaching, writing, review, recommendation or display of the Work, **including reference to its ideas, designs, architectures and thinking without copying any specific expression**.

**1.3 "Derivative Work"** means any new work based on all or part of the Work, including modified, translated, compiled, ported, refactored or re-packaged versions, and any implementation of the Work's ideas or designs in another language, platform or product.

**1.4 "Commercial Use"** means any use for profit, including sale, bundling with goods or services, integration into commercial products, paid services, internal commercial operations, or using the Work to attract customers.

**1.5 "Attribution Information"** means a statement containing all of: (i) the Author's name "Youchen (游尘)"; (ii) the original source link; (iii) the Work's name; (iv) this license's name and version (YOSL-1.0). The specific content for each Work is listed in its accompanying `NOTICE` file.

### 2. Grant of Rights

Subject to full compliance with this license (especially Section 3, Attribution), the Author grants you a worldwide, perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free, non-exclusive, sublicensable license to:

**2.1** use, install, run and copy the Work;
**2.2** modify, adapt, translate, compile, refactor and create derivative works;
**2.3** publish, distribute, sublicense and transfer;
**2.4** **use commercially** — including selling, integrating into commercial products, providing paid services and internal commercial operations — without any fee or further permission;
**2.5** use for study, teaching, research, competitions, public-interest projects and personal projects;
**2.6** incorporate into closed-source or open-source projects, subject to Section 3.

### 3. Attribution (Core Condition)

**3.1** Any Reference must clearly, prominently, legibly and durably state the origin and the Author, including at least: (a) the Author: **Youchen (游尘)**; (b) the original source link (see the Work's `NOTICE`); (c) the Work's name and version; (d) this license's name and version: Yuchen Open Source License 1.0 (YOSL-1.0).

**3.2** Attribution must appear in a position proportionate to the Reference — e.g. source file headers or project README/`NOTICE`/`CREDITS`; an "About / Acknowledgements / Open Source Licenses" screen for software, plugins and apps; cover, footer or "Source & Acknowledgements" section for documents; citation or acknowledgements for articles and papers; title, acknowledgement or closing credits for talks and videos; image corner, caption or delivery notes for images and designs; and an explicit "idea source" note when only ideas, designs or architectures are referenced.

**3.3** Modified versions must prominently state: "This work is modified from 《Work Name》 by Youchen", with a brief description of changes and dates.

**3.4** You must not remove, obscure or alter copyright notices, Attribution Information or this license. When distributing the Work or a Derivative Work, you must include this license (`LICENSE`) and the `NOTICE` file.

**3.5** You must not suggest that the Author endorses your work, product, service, position or conduct without prior written consent.

**3.6** Commercial Use does not exempt you from attribution; "white-label" or de-identification is not permitted.

**3.7** You must not pass off the Work, in whole or in substantial part, as your own original creation.

### 4. Ideas and Design Attribution

**4.1** Design ideas, architectures, methods, algorithms, frameworks and opinions disclosed in the Work may not constitute protectable "expression" under copyright law. Nevertheless, the Author expressly requires anyone who borrows, references, restates, rewrites, or builds upon them to state: "Idea source: 《Work Name》 by Youchen".

**4.2** This Section is the Author's public attribution requirement and a condition of using this license. It does not restrict anyone from using these ideas — it only asks beneficiaries to state their source.

**4.3** This Section does not claim exclusivity over ideas, nor does it restrict independent creation of similar ideas.

### 5. Giving Back

**5.1** The Author encourages (but does not require) you to contribute improvements, fixes and enhancements back to the original project or to the Chinese open-source community.
**5.2** The Author encourages (but does not require) you to help others and pass this openness on.
**5.3** This license carries no political position and does not require agreement with any view of the Author.

### 6. Disclaimer of Warranty

**6.1** The Work is provided "AS IS", without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, title and non-infringement.
**6.2** In no event shall the Author be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, punitive or consequential damages, including loss of data, device damage, business interruption or lost profits, even if advised of such possibility.
**6.3** You are solely responsible for evaluating fitness and bearing the risk of use. For system-level, security-level or production operations, verify in an isolated environment first.

### 7. Termination and Reinstatement

**7.1** Any violation of this license (especially Section 3) automatically terminates all rights granted to you.
**7.2** If you cure the violation within 30 days after notice from the Author, your rights are automatically reinstated.
**7.3** Termination does not affect liability for violations before termination, nor the effect of Section 6.

### 8. License Versions

**8.1** The current effective version is 1.0 (YOSL-1.0).
**8.2** The Author may publish later versions; a Work not stating a version is governed by the latest published version.
**8.3** Works released under an earlier version may continue to be used under that version.

### 9. Governing Law and Disputes

**9.1** This license is governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China.
**9.2** Disputes shall first be resolved through friendly negotiation; failing that, by the competent people's court at the Author's domicile.

### 10. Miscellaneous

**10.1** This license does not exclude, limit or transfer the Author's moral rights, including the right of attribution, the right of modification and the right of integrity, which are inalienable and perpetual.
**10.2** If any provision is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full effect.
**10.3** This license is published in Chinese and English, both equally authentic; in case of ambiguity, the Chinese text prevails.
**10.4** This license supersedes any prior oral or written license for the same Work.

